sequenceDiagram
    participant Check as Bounded step (3000ms)
    participant Observer as Input navigation observer
    participant Browser as Electron native input
    participant Old as Old document
    participant New as New main document
    Check->>Observer: register before native input
    Check->>Browser: trusted input dispatch
    Check->>Old: paint promise
    alt main document navigation
        Browser-->>Observer: did-start-navigation main, not same document
        Observer-->>Check: navigation wins paint race
        New-->>Observer: did-frame-finish-load main
        Observer-->>Check: loaded
        Check->>New: paint current document
    else same-document or ordinary action
        Old-->>Check: paint resolved
    end
    alt load failure
        Browser-->>Observer: main load/provisional failure
        Observer-->>Check: failed (cannot pass)
    else cancel or step timeout
        Check->>Browser: destroy window, preserve Stop reason
        Browser-->>Observer: destroyed
        Observer->>Observer: settle outstanding wait and dispose
    end
    Check->>Observer: finally dispose (idempotent)
